Package: Z6Vx8
Title: Utilities for Analyzing Single-Nucleus RNA Sequencing Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Anna", "Luo", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions for analyzing single-nucleus RNA sequencing data. Utilities 
    include multi-fold clustering, computing consensus NMF components, and performing 
    differential expression tests using pseudobulk or GLMM-based methods. Utilities 
    for processing annotated gene sets for pathway analysis, and plotting functions 
    are also included.
